WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.770
<v Guide>A world can begin with just a few words.

2
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.350
<v Keeper>The beacon is still burning.

3
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.990
<v Keeper>Follow it toward shore.

4
00:00:22.203 --> 00:00:24.673
<v Guide>Then someone answers from across the water.

5
00:00:28.137 --> 00:00:29.087
<v Traveler>I see it now.

6
00:00:29.417 --> 00:00:30.427
<v Traveler>Keep the light on.

7
00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.850
<v Guide>Give their conversation a shoreline.

8
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:48.693
[Ocean waves]

9
00:00:48.853 --> 00:00:51.743
<v Guide>A character can return without losing their voice.

10
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.670
<v Keeper (clone)>I'll keep it burning until you're home.

11
00:01:07.697 --> 00:01:11.527
<v Guide>Place every line where it belongs, and let the sea sit underneath.

12
00:01:14.437 --> 00:01:17.727
<v Guide>A voice... an answer... the sound of the sea.

13
00:01:17.837 --> 00:01:19.507
<v Guide>Together, they become a scene.

14
00:01:19.939 --> 00:01:21.839
[Ocean waves under the scene]

15
00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.629
<v Keeper>The beacon is still burning.

16
00:01:23.859 --> 00:01:25.269
<v Keeper>Follow it toward shore.

17
00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:26.819
<v Traveler>I see it now.

18
00:01:27.149 --> 00:01:28.159
<v Traveler>Keep the light on.

19
00:01:28.959 --> 00:01:31.109
<v Keeper (clone)>I'll keep it burning until you're home.

20
00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:38.446
<v Brand narrator>Sonic Rift.

21
00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:40.826
<v Brand narrator>Make worlds you can hear.

